EXT. ROOFTOP - DAY

JAX, a nimble thief in a black hoodie, runs across the rooftop. OFFICER KANE, a tall policeman in uniform, chases him.

KANE
Stop! Police!

Jax jumps over the gap and rolls. Kane stops at the edge.

JAX
(laughing)
Too slow, old man!

Jax waves and runs away. Kane kicks the wall.
